                      (      ../abort.as):00001         * Adapted from cmoc_os9/lib/todo/abort.as for the live cmoc_os9 ABI.
                      (      ../abort.as):00002         *
                      (      ../abort.as):00003         * The original Kreider abort path tried to dump process memory through
                      (      ../abort.as):00004         * startup-module symbols. The live CMOC runtime does not use that startup
                      (      ../abort.as):00005         * model, so the practical libc contract here is simply: do not return.
                      (      ../abort.as):00006         
                      (      ../abort.as):00007                             section   code      ; begin code section
                      (      ../abort.as):00008         
                      (      ../abort.as):00009         _abort              EXPORT              ; export this symbol
                      (      ../abort.as):00010         
     0006             (      ../abort.as):00011         F_Exit              equ       $06       ; define constant as $06
                      (      ../abort.as):00012         
0000                  (      ../abort.as):00013         _abort
0000 CC00FF           (      ../abort.as):00014                             ldd       #255      ; conventional abnormal exit status
0003 103F06           (      ../abort.as):00015                             os9       F_Exit    ; invoke OS-9 system call F_Exit
                      (      ../abort.as):00016         
                      (      ../abort.as):00017                             endsect             ; end current section
